ufbx v0.23.1, commit 26a482ae66871d7de36eb722aa060bce95bce274
https://github.com/ufbx/ufbx/tree/v0.23.1
Vendored native C source/header, unmodified. Selected MIT license (see LICENSE).
No Python runtime or proprietary FBX SDK is used.

Primary evaluation: ufbx exposes native hierarchy, instances, geometric/pivot/
inheritance helpers, material maps, corner attributes, skins, blend shapes, OBJ
MTL and bounded allocators/progress callbacks. OpenFBX was considered, but ufbx's
explicit coordinate/inheritance policies and OBJ+FBX shared native reader fit
source-retaining authoring. v0.23.1 includes September 2026 adversarial input
bounds fixes. External I/O must use Dome Sculpt's confined capture callback;
never enable ufbx's default arbitrary filesystem resolver.

